      "zh": "组合层风险",
      "en": "Combination-Layer Risks",
      "zh_body": "组合命中来自框架×插件×operator×存储×通信×硬件路线的交叉判定（combos 表）：单一组件各自合规时组合仍可成立攻击链，单点修复不消除组合层风险。",
      "en_body": "Combination hits come from cross-checking framework x plugin x operator x storage x transport x hardware routes (combos table): a chain can hold even when every single component is individually compliant, so point fixes do not remove combination-layer risk."
