  "compliance": {
    "intro_zh": "本矩阵把每条发现映射至 2026-10 公开可用的七套 AI 安全与治理框架：OWASP LLM Top 10（2026 正式版，附 2025 旧编号 crosswalk）、OWASP Agentic AI Top 10（ASI01–ASI10，2026）、MITRE ATLAS 技术、NIST AI RMF 1.0、ISO/IEC 42001:2023、EU AI Act GPAI 义务（Art. 53/55）与 TC260/《生成式人工智能服务管理暂行办法》。映射为工程辅助与整改追踪口径，不构成合规认证结论；未命中具体类别的发现使用平台面兜底条款。",
    "intro_en": "This matrix maps every finding to seven publicly available AI security and governance frameworks as of 2026-10: OWASP LLM Top 10 (2026 release with 2025 ID crosswalk), OWASP Agentic AI Top 10 (ASI01-ASI10, 2026), MITRE ATLAS techniques, NIST AI RMF 1.0, ISO/IEC 42001:2023, EU AI Act GPAI obligations (Art. 53/55) and TC260 / China Interim Measures for Generative AI Services. Mapping is an engineering aid and remediation-tracking convention, not a certification opinion; findings without a specific category fall back to platform-level clauses.",
